# Service Account Keys & Secrets
#
# Blocking every .json is a blunt way to keep credentials out, and it silently
# took several files that have to be in the repository with it: without the npm
# lockfile the image cannot `npm ci`, and nobody can reproduce the dependency
# tree; without the dashboard definitions the Grafana setup is not reviewable.
# The negations below are the files that must be tracked.
*.json
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.node.json
!infra/grafana/dashboards/*.json
!.github/**/*.json
